<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Syscomm prices at $5.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Syscomm prices at $5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Syscomm International Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $5</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	    $5 - $5.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			1,250,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter    Commonwealth Associates</p>
<p>NOTE: The planned initial public offering in Syscomm Corp modified its terms by cutting its estimated price range to $5.00-$5.50 from $6.00-$8.00 and lowering the proposed number of shares. Initially an offering for 1.6 million shares was filed. The proposed number of shares were reduced to 1.5 million shares and later lowered to 1.25 million shares.</p>
</text>
